Falsifies `extensible_host_controller_interface::verification::an_endpoint_context_keeps_each_field_in_its_own_bits`.

The defect: `endpoint` forgets to mask the endpoint type to its three bits, so a type code above 7 spills into the reserved bit 6, Host Initiate Disable and Max Burst Size.

Expected to fail: the harness's check that bits 6 to 15 of dword 1 are zero.

diff --git a/src/context.rs b/src/context.rs
--- a/src/context.rs
+++ b/src/context.rs
@@ -98,7 +98,7 @@
     };
     [
         (interval as u32) << 16,
-        3 << 1 | (kind as u32 & 0x7) << 3 | (maximum_packet as u32) << 16,
+        3 << 1 | (kind as u32) << 3 | (maximum_packet as u32) << 16,
         dequeue as u32,
         (dequeue >> 32) as u32,
         average_transfer_request_block_bytes as u32 | maximum_service_interval_payload << 16,
